nds on the outcomes of the validation campaign (validated model list) and the productization, training, and quota work; this epic is scheduled after those complete.\n- Priority derived from the strategy's overall priority (Major) per the docs-authoring exception, not from the HLR's P2 label.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41632,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b8cd0f36882c8f34","agent_id":"a10cfa25a5e863fb5","session_id":"bc9ea267-6fda-4bac-95a7-007b50b2b12c","uuid":"7e73799e-bb07-4243-8708-ea4163775856","timestamp":"2026-10-23T19:08:00.557Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9020"}
